  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c41467dcc6747d1e66346f/step-6bd71bb6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Grate carrot. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and 1/2 the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c41467dcc6747d1e66346f/step-6dbac356.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, corn, shredded Cheddar cheese, plain flour, egg, milk, vegetable stock, curry spice blend and remaining garlic. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base. When the oil is hot, add 1/4 cups of fritter mixture and flatten using a spatula. Cook in batches until golden and cooked through, 3-4 mins each side (allow fritters to set before flipping!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Repeat with remaining mixture, adding extra olive oil as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c41467dcc6747d1e66346f/step-a86e68bc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato. In a medium bowl, combine tomato, cos lettuce leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• Divide corn fritters, sweet potato fries and salad between plates.\n• Serve with garlic yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c41467dcc6747d1e66346f/step-e8bd108d.jpg"
    }
  ]
